OL,8,     Gdiary, Eva decided to find her
OL,9,     Gbeloved brother Heinz's hidden
OL,10,     Gcache of paintings.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GMore than 40,000 men were killed
OL,13,     Gduring the Battle of Gallipoli in
OL,14,     G1915. New Zealand soldier Rupert
OL,15,     GWestmacott was injured and
OL,16,     Grecalled one of the worst battles
OL,17,     Gof World War One.
